# Build-context filter for Dockerfile.artifacts-seed
# (context root = this micro-integrations/db-jpa directory).
# Whitelist: only the DB CLI source and the Designer artifacts payload --
# keeps the multi-GB image tars / jars out of the build context.
*
!DB CLI/jpa-entity-generator/pom.xml
!DB CLI/jpa-entity-generator/src/**
!DB Designer/artifacts/**
# Connector binaries are a user upload via the Designer UI -- never seeded.
DB Designer/artifacts/connectorType/**
# Prebuilt CLI jars are ignored: stage 1 builds the CLI from source.
DB Designer/artifacts/tools/jpa-entity-generator*.jar
